  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資料結構",
    "sub_ename": "DATA STRUCTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目標在於讓學生經由實習課程的進行，學習程式設計的技巧與訓練程式設計的能力。本課程主要訓練學生(1)能夠以高階的抽象型式適當地來定義需要的資料結構及演算法，(2)能夠設計各種資料結構實作方法，(3)能夠正確利用各種資料結構於各種程式的練習，以及(4)具有分析各種資料結構運算時間複雜度的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to make the students, via the practical training, to learn the skills of programming and have the ability of programming. The course mainly includes (1) the ability to define at an appropriately high level of abstraction the data structures and algorithms that needed, (2) the ability to devise alternative implementations of data structures, (3) the ability to employ different data structures in algorithm design, and (4) the ability to analyze the time complexity of data structures' operation.",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1000計算機概論(一)、IEE1001計算機概論(二)、IEE1002計算機概論實習(一)、IEE1003計算機概論實習(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IEE1000",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IEE1000 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(1)、IEE1001 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(2)、IEE1002 THE  PROGRAMMING LABORATORY(1)、IEE1003 THE  PROGRAMMING LABORATORY(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
